<section class="homepage-section about">
  <h2>What Is CleanPNG?</h2>
  <p>
    CleanPNG is a professional PNG image library offering high-quality transparent illustrations for business, marketing, education, and presentations.
  </p>

  <h3>Why Choose CleanPNG?</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Editorial-style PNG illustrations designed for real business use</li>
    <li>High-resolution transparent backgrounds</li>
    <li>Commercial-friendly usage</li>
    <li>Easy search by emotion, object, and scenario</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="homepage-section faq">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <details>
    <summary>What makes CleanPNG different from other PNG websites?</summary>
    <p>CleanPNG focuses on editorial-style PNG illustrations designed specifically for real business, marketing, and presentation use.</p>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>What formats and resolutions are available?</summary>
    <p>All images are provided in high-resolution PNG format with transparent backgrounds.</p>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Are CleanPNG images free to download?</summary>
    <p>Yes. All PNG images on CleanPNG are free to download and use. You can use them in personal and commercial projects without attribution, unless otherwise stated on the asset page.</p>
  </details>


  <details>
    <summary>Are the PNG images transparent?</summary>
    <p>Yes, all CleanPNG images feature transparent backgrounds for easy integration.</p>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Do you support customization or diversity?</summary>
    <p>Our collection includes diverse characters, styles, and scenarios to fit various needs.</p>
  </details>
</section>

